# Cloudflare Pages security headers for the admin dashboard.
#
# CLAUDE.md and docs/CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_SETUP.md name Cloudflare Pages as the
# hosting target for apps/admin_web. Until this file existed, the only headers
# configuration in the repo was vercel.json -- so the *documented* deployment
# path shipped with no security headers at all, while the undocumented one had
# them. This restores parity.
#
# Kept byte-for-byte equivalent to vercel.json so the two hosts cannot drift.
# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the build output root; Flutter web
# copies web/ into build/web verbatim, so it lands in the right place.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
